<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta continues airstrikes, recently bombing a Karen village and damaging homes and vehicles, and it also attacked two naval vessels on the Kaladan River, which were reported sunk. Thai authorities announced that an ASEAN envoy will visit Myanmar while the US is reported to be undermining the EU diplomatic blockade on the junta. The regime imprisoned two Islamic teachers and seized a mosque, and four people were charged over a Molotov attack on a Myanmar refugee settlement. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/myanmar-is-the-us-undermining-the-eu-s-diplomatic-blockade/a-79778863?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOVGdSN0toZHZUdF83RzFxOXg0OU1zVkU1OFJpOTlFVGF5NmFTbWxsUENuNkR4X0tuLXVNSDEyREo0NVMtMGxpampQdDdQQzA4RUJpV3ppemYtR081ZXBOcXBoTVZ2VVNHMHFuOGk1cWxETk9TdG4zTHVuZlFjaVhZQlpnOVV1TzFzcXc5cWIwekkzcS16ek16Zg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNSWl4SlBja1R4RkhhaTMxemplMld0aldQMmlzbzdsOVlPMnJFWVNwRVVMa1dnanFtOVctTlEyWjl0SnI4Q3I4TzQ4QU5LRjRtX3BKSXc2RE5tQTNRSWhKYXlvX01QdE1OZWlQc1d4ZkZwWWxVQTVGLUR1NWFVWjZYcFNvNDJXS1hOYXUtVWRQSkdwMVZ5MGtUcHpjUTI3TjZ6M0VZaUdhLVdSTzA5UXkyYXlWUTFyRHlXb0tF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPMEoyNTRacGFNellGb0JqTUVRYXNWbWxoZkczZmFuLU1FczhkZEFsYUV6Nk1Iay1Jc2xDc0F0aDFGUEhEZHBHdlFka0p3czBFb0dRSEF4UjRkUnliVERuNkNiVkRmZHhrMnA5US01a3BaZ0o1TG1PMXJWZjNRb1A0bklWNVNvTURROWtYQjl1XzYzMjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/article